</div>
<div class="onsite-author">Vanessa Peel</div>
<div class="onsite-source">Google Review</div>
</div>

<div class="onsite-review">
<div class="onsite-stars">★★★★★</div>
<div class="onsite-text">
"Excellent training centre and very welcoming. The courses are very informative and there is practical training as well as theory. Very enjoyable and informative."
</div>
<div class="onsite-author">Paddy Cain</div>
<div class="onsite-source">Google Review</div>
</div>

<div class="onsite-review">
<div class="onsite-stars">★★★★★</div>
<div class="onsite-text">
